      205  == Culture {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      206  In the Căușeni District there are: 37 houses of culture, several folk bands with a Title 31 model, and 74 amateur artistic groups with a total of 1200 participants. There is a School of Arts in [[Căușeni]] city, a school of Music in both [[Căinari]] and [[Copanca]], a museum of history and [[ethnogr
      207  == Health {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      208  Health services are provided in Căușeni District through: a general fund hospital with 292 beds, 19 [[Magnetic field imaging]] (MFI) units, 13 [[health center|health centres]], 5 health points, and 13 clinical diagnostic laboratories.
